{"unit_id":"syOPV__dsh-theme-background-center#readme-1","repo":"syOPV/dsh-theme-background-center","commit":"06ff231740697a3f3119be72f5f715677bbbee2c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-background-center README · dsh-theme-background-center：给 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)（`dsh`）Web UI 的主题美化插件，一个面板搞定主题、背景、氛围灯。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-theme-background-center"}
{"unit_id":"syOPV__dsh-theme-background-center#readme-2","repo":"syOPV/dsh-theme-background-center","commit":"06ff231740697a3f3119be72f5f715677bbbee2c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-background-center README · 功能：- 🎨 **主题切换**：深夜蓝 / 护眼绿 / 赛博朋克 / 纸墨白，另有一键随机配色\n- 🌈 **梦幻渐变背景**：梦幻紫 / 薰衣草 / 极光 / 蜜桃，自带缓慢流动动画\n- 🖼️ **自定义图片背景**：上传本地图片作背景，自动压缩，透明度可调\n- 🧊 **毛玻璃**：一键给面板加磨砂质感\n- 💡 **环绕流动氛围灯**：输入框边缘霓虹灯管光环 + 邻近色渐变光带流动，7 色可选、速度 1～10 秒可调\n- 💾 **自动保存**：所有设置刷新 / 重开后自动恢复","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"syOPV__dsh-theme-background-center#readme-3","repo":"syOPV/dsh-theme-background-center","commit":"06ff231740697a3f3119be72f5f715677bbbee2c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-background-center README · 安装：> 前置：已安装 DeepSeek Harness（Node.js 22.19+ 或 24+），能运行 `dsh`。\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/syOPV/dsh-theme-background-center.git\ncd dsh-theme-background-center\ndsh plugin --profile web add .\n```\n\n安装后重启 `dsh web` 即可。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"syOPV__dsh-theme-background-center#readme-4","repo":"syOPV/dsh-theme-background-center","commit":"06ff231740697a3f3119be72f5f715677bbbee2c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-background-center README · 使用：1. 打开 Web UI，进入 **设置 → 常规**\n2. 找到「主题背景」面板\n3. 点主题 / 选渐变 / 上传图片 / 开毛玻璃 / 挑氛围灯颜色，即时生效","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
